sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Admin
    participant V as Vue 3 + Inertia<br/>Admin/Booking/Verifikasi.vue
    participant C as BookingAdminController
    participant S as LayananBooking
    participant O as Eloquent<br/>Member, Booking, BookCopy
    participant DB as MySQL 8.4
    A->>V: Pilih booking Diajukan → Setujui → konfirmasi
    V->>C: POST /admin/booking/{kode}/setujui (Gate kelola-transaksi)
    C->>S: setujui(kodeBooking, admin)
    S->>S: rekonsiliasiEksemplar() pada eksemplar booking
    rect rgb(235, 242, 255)
        Note over S,DB: DB::transaction — kunci members → bookings → book_copies
        S->>DB: SELECT … FOR UPDATE ×3
        alt Bukan Diajukan / anggota Nonaktif / eksemplar tidak tersedia
            S-->>V: galat validasi — pesan galat (booking dapat ditolak)
        else Valid
            S->>O: Booking → Disetujui, decided_at, expires_at = +48 jam, staff_id
            O->>DB: UPDATE bookings (UNIQUE reserved_copy_id)
            alt Eksemplar sudah direservasi booking lain (1062)
